# <lang><zh-CN>仅忽略可由锁定依赖/构建命令恢复的本地安装、UniApp 产物、编辑器和临时文件；不忽略项目数据、图片来源或声明文件。</zh-CN><en>Ignore only local installs, UniApp artifacts, editor files, and temporary files recoverable from locked dependencies/build commands; do not ignore project data, image provenance, or declarations.</en></lang>
node_modules/
dist/
.pnpm-store/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.local
# <lang><zh-CN>Playwright CLI 的会话截图、trace 与 snapshot 是可重建的本地视觉检查输出；正式接受证据另存私有 WorkZone。</zh-CN><en>Playwright CLI session screenshots, traces, and snapshots are reproducible local visual-check output; formal acceptance evidence is retained separately in the private WorkZone.</en></lang>
/output/playwright/
# <lang><zh-CN>字体维护脚本产生的 Python bytecode 可由锁定解释器重建，不进入源码或发布资产。</zh-CN><en>Python bytecode emitted by the font-maintenance script is reproducible from the pinned interpreter and enters neither source nor release assets.</en></lang>
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
